# Extra browser origins allowed to call this API, comma separated.
#
# localhost:5173, 127.0.0.1:5173 and localhost:4173 are always allowed, so this
# can stay empty for local development.
#
# In production it is REQUIRED: the app refuses to start without it when RENDER
# is set. An unset value would leave the allowlist at localhost only, and every
# request from the deployed frontend would be blocked by the browser and shown
# to the user as an unreachable model service.
#
# Render: https://mylumi.onrender.com
FRONTEND_ORIGINS=
